# No secrets exist in this project today — contact forms are mailto: only,
# and the admin login is a client-side demo placeholder pending Lovable's
# real auth. This file is a placeholder for whenever that changes.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed VITE_ to the client bundle — never put
# a real secret (API key, DB password, etc.) behind a VITE_ variable, since
# it ships to every visitor's browser. Server-only secrets belong in
# Lovable's own environment variable settings, not here.
#
# VITE_EXAMPLE_PUBLIC_VALUE=
